---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Parks on the Air in WA
description: Recent POTA activations from Western Australian parks, and the top VK6 activators and hunters.
permalink: /portable/pota/
---
<header class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Portable · Parks on the Air</p>
    <h1>WA parks this week</h1>
    <p class="lede">Who's been out activating Western Australia's parks, and the VK6 activators and hunters at the top of the table. For live spots, see POTA itself.</p>
    <p class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://pota.app/#/" rel="noopener">Who's on air now? Live spots on pota.app ↗</a> <a class="button ghost" href="{{ '/portable/pota/stats/' | url }}">VK6 stats and archive</a></p>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="wrap">
{%- if pota %}
  <div class="pota-grid">
    <section class="card pota-panel" style="--bar: var(--green)">
      <h2>This week</h2>
      {%- if pota.week.length %}<ul class="feed">{% for a in pota.week %}{% include "partials/pota-act.njk" %}{% endfor %}</ul>
      {%- else %}<p class="muted">No WA activations logged yet this week.</p>{% endif %}
      {%- if pota.month.length %}
      <h3>Earlier this month</h3>
      <ul class="feed">{% for a in pota.month | limit(8) %}{% include "partials/pota-act.njk" %}{% endfor %}</ul>
      {%- endif %}
      <p class="small muted">{{ pota.monthCount }} WA activations in the last 30 days. Logs reach POTA when activators upload them, so the week fills in over a few days.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="card pota-panel" style="--bar: var(--accent)">
      <h2>Top VK6 activators <small>last 12 months, WA parks</small></h2>
      <div class="table-scroll plain"><table class="lb"><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Callsign</th><th class="r">Activations</th><th class="r">Parks</th><th class="r">QSOs</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      {%- for e in pota.activatorsYear | limit(10) %}<tr><td class="rank">{{ loop.index }}</td><td><b>{{ e.call }}</b></td><td class="r">{{ e.activations }}</td><td class="r">{{ e.parks }}</td><td class="r">{{ e.qsos | thousands }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      </tbody></table></div>
    </section>
    <section class="card pota-panel" style="--bar: var(--navy)">
      <h2>Top VK6 hunters <small>all-time, parks worldwide</small></h2>
      <div class="table-scroll plain"><table class="lb"><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Callsign</th><th class="r">Parks</th><th class="r">QSOs</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      {%- for e in pota.hunters | limit(10) %}<tr><td class="rank">{{ loop.index }}</td><td><b>{{ e.call }}</b></td><td class="r">{{ e.parks | thousands }}</td><td class="r">{{ e.qsos | thousands }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      </tbody></table></div>
      <p class="small muted">POTA has no list of WA hunters, so this covers the {{ pota.totals.huntersChecked }} VK6 callsigns seen as activators or top hunters of WA parks. Missing? Let us know.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <section class="pota-challenge card" style="--bar: var(--gold)">
    <h2>Activate the unactivated</h2>
    <p><b>{{ pota.parks.never | thousands }}</b> of WA's <b>{{ pota.parks.total | thousands }}</b> parks have never been activated, {{ pota.parks.nearPerthNever }} of them within about 40 km of Perth{% if pota.parks.nearPerthExamples.length %}, such as {% for p in pota.parks.nearPerthExamples %}{{ p.name }} ({{ p.ref }}){% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}. First activations get a mention on NewsWest.</p>
  </section>
  <p class="small muted pota-source">Figures from the POTA public API (api.pota.app), updated {{ pota.generated | perthTime }} Perth time. Callsigns shown are public on POTA; ask us if you'd rather not be listed.</p>
{%- else %}
  <p class="notice">POTA figures aren't available yet. In the meantime, see <a href="https://pota.app/">pota.app</a>.</p>
{%- endif %}
</div>
